<h3 class="tribe-events-pro-photo__event-title tribe-common-h6" style="line-height: 1.2; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 18px; color: #00539B; margin: 0 0 17px;">Saturday's Performance of "The Best Christmas Pageant Ever" is Canceled</h3>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">Due to the significant snow expected, this evening's performance of "<a href="https://columbusrecparks.com/calendar/the-best-christmas-pageant-ever-2/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" title="The Best Christmas Pageant Ever" class="tribe-events-pro-photo__event-title-link tribe-common-anchor-thin" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #9D4359;">The Best Christmas Pageant Ever</a>" to ensure the safety of the cast, the audience and our staff. All tickets purchased for today's performance will be honored at tomorrow's performance at 2 p.m. </p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">We appreciate your understanding, and hope you can join us tomorrow! </p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">Be safe!</p>
